            <div xml:id="m-7b1178fc-9f92-4934-9aa5-17c388642aaf">
              <lg xml:id="m-4e202311-6782-4451-810f-34ce4075f9a4">
                <l xml:id="m-d8d258fe-8dd4-4d57-89c8-cebb13dcbb4e" facs="#m-2a1e1e93-645d-4cae-9ac1-761bf0fe25de" label="text-like">The Epiphany of our Lord.</l><l xml:id="m-f73bae8d-97c3-460d-96ae-51a12009045b" facs="#m-2b30965c-726c-4ee3-815d-088625ffbf77" label="ambiguous">459</l><l xml:id="m-81d9cb0f-c35c-4faf-aa0f-58be7e93d881" facs="#m-48d3d222-9ef7-44ae-9a03-62ad8d0e2b8a" label="text-like">AT MASS.</l><l xml:id="m-3344486b-8e52-489c-87cc-c9c4c58be4c3" facs="#m-2d57ea61-58c4-4dc9-be17-28bfd72aa299" label="ambiguous">Intr.</l><l xml:id="m-3b617b1e-1053-4dff-b4a3-6af001840876" facs="#m-09009e51-4471-4d88-a85b-604a74d7c39c" label="ambiguous">2.</l><l xml:id="m-d1cdbe92-9df7-42a9-a3fb-779a5c68bd09" facs="#m-a49de82c-cb39-4330-9055-14c1012cd942" label="lyrics-like">C-ce “ advé- nit domi-nátor Dó-mi- nus:</l><l xml:id="m-811cc130-f310-4e6f-8618-ef00277a025c" facs="#m-9af9b9eb-7f29-4699-815c-67e0b6705ffc" label="ambiguous">M</l><l xml:id="m-3aff77e3-8ff9-44f8-bd93-2861e21f654a" facs="#m-9a4bc333-4f71-4e67-a8e8-ab2db254a502" label="lyrics-like">et régnum in má¬ nu é- jus, et pot-éstas, et</l><l xml:id="m-753f2f87-5691-4f4f-ae96-3ee8c5589cdd" facs="#m-2867a3a3-5fca-495e-9d02-9abe351c29a5" label="lyrics-like">impé- ri- um. Ps. Dé-us, judí-ci-um tú-um Régi da:</l><l xml:id="m-848ca35a-d4ca-4ba3-ad46-2676f2704e33" facs="#m-4ede8218-a86e-447e-b7fc-288365673447" label="lyrics-like">et justí-ti-am tú-am Fí-li-oRé-gis. Gló-ri-a Pátri.</l><l xml:id="m-b94cdc8d-73c6-44e1-ab89-f430add0ab50" facs="#m-6e638c25-bf10-4a89-b294-e449d651b2ce" label="ambiguous">E u o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-a74b249c-4e77-4663-bac1-e1b8f02ad0f2" facs="#m-f284c8b1-a498-47bc-97f1-4296676915eb" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-912c9391-7675-4222-9fdb-a59308263e8e" facs="#m-5b0f12a7-a2d0-44ff-82f6-d6e511dcaa21" label="lyrics-like">Eus, qui hodiérna die Unigéni-] usque ad contemplándam spéciem</l><l xml:id="m-ce8cc520-5c83-49e4-a7ac-bd6a3da3e6c7" facs="#m-cbe55c7d-169f-4052-bdfd-c6ba01756981" label="lyrics-like">tuae celsitúdinis perducámur. Per</l><l xml:id="m-d69052d6-5973-4fc6-b80f-33e4dc7ab77e" facs="#m-4d2f8772-b481-4a6a-a3b6-65549ad64037" label="lyrics-like">I tum tuum géntibus stella duce</l><l xml:id="m-768a5e3d-b2c7-4dfe-bb3b-4d1b57b77723" facs="#m-1e62ec97-b591-4b8a-8118-6dd933ad794e" label="lyrics-like">eúmdem Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-20243a35-27ac-4595-8609-cfb0f8083f6e" facs="#m-b9f0b669-8d11-449e-b908-fc9105922f8f" label="lyrics-like">revelásti: t concéde propitius: ut</l><l xml:id="m-b08649b4-6477-44c0-8821-760c95d67365" facs="#m-a9cba28f-c763-4be1-bd00-a74f4af21cb9" label="lyrics-like">qui jam te ex fide cognóvimus,</l><l xml:id="m-c651f86f-5ebb-4fa4-b101-9dbc524af3e3" facs="#m-ced8ebf4-c0bd-416d-b26e-d1c523544d12" label="text-like">Lectio Isaiae Prophetae. Is. 60.</l><l xml:id="m-c5c18a85-6b91-40ce-bf15-9ceefab330d9" facs="#m-ba3e985f-3df9-420b-9bb2-cdd8684a6b29" label="lyrics-like">NUrge, illumináre Jerúsalem:</l><l xml:id="m-850367e4-dfdf-42f9-8a68-da4838d0ff9f" facs="#m-8e0c7470-da85-4857-9af8-bfd84453ad09" label="lyrics-like">ge vénient, et filiae tuae de látere</l><l xml:id="m-2267f100-6e0a-494d-b9bd-ac5209e70991" facs="#m-853df1ed-98f2-49e0-8603-e4f1d885199c" label="lyrics-like">A quia venit lumen tuum, et gló¬</l><l xml:id="m-afec9a24-cff7-4958-abd4-1549a86eaf75" facs="#m-f8124c3a-ccf8-42c3-a009-7d60d0b17303" label="lyrics-like">surgent. Tunc vidébis, et áflues,</l><l xml:id="m-883d9431-f06b-4de0-8096-acb04aff494c" facs="#m-23bd6999-53ca-4df8-8022-8e319952c878" label="lyrics-like">ria Dómini super te orta est. Quia</l><l xml:id="m-04146848-ff4c-4828-8ca5-ada0f8dd9c9b" facs="#m-e0c28649-4c38-44be-b979-1bddaa462111" label="lyrics-like">mirabitur et dilatábitur cor tuum,</l><l xml:id="m-1a4ebdba-55b8-48ae-bdc7-ed8cc4d92fa0" facs="#m-4f259871-df6e-4056-a884-efcd5d459688" label="lyrics-like">quando convérsa fúerit ad te mul¬</l><l xml:id="m-cd8eea31-c4c8-4a9d-a006-7be4dbaa5c29" facs="#m-422a557a-b09c-40c5-ba8b-fcb4ad0e2b9f" label="lyrics-like">ecce ténebrae opérient terram, et</l><l xml:id="m-a203a631-86a7-48ca-a15a-378dfc1fc1bc" facs="#m-826134ad-a220-472c-8880-2ba69503f3cc" label="lyrics-like">titúdo maris, fortitúdo géntium vé¬</l><l xml:id="m-2ea5f00c-b4e4-446f-9fce-191c8dd1f030" facs="#m-659cd43d-d20c-4abc-9c73-5ee4ff7ed9ae" label="lyrics-like">caligo pópulos: super te autem orié¬</l><l xml:id="m-c1254d15-26c6-4a40-a8b5-b487fccff959" facs="#m-ad046350-ed5b-40fc-9269-091b6811068a" label="lyrics-like">nerit tibi. Inundátio camelórum</l><l xml:id="m-6dc415d0-193a-4d2c-9ee6-801b0a6c42f5" facs="#m-bdd22b28-d554-48bb-896f-5fdaa0406b4c" label="lyrics-like">tur Dóminus, et glória ejus in te</l><l xml:id="m-a693be2c-df99-4065-8914-a56b16ab4c1c" facs="#m-2785f4a1-f0c9-453e-a252-bb44793c6922" label="lyrics-like">vidébitur. Et ambulábunt gentes in</l><l xml:id="m-d5e6168a-9a6b-4786-92f4-87f6776b1513" facs="#m-2f8f0fb8-0712-4ad2-87a2-0ddb3eaf81c1" label="lyrics-like">opériet te, dromedárii Mádian et</l><l xml:id="m-1a404034-fae3-487a-bf26-16412af6c7bd" facs="#m-f90d56af-a6ef-4c31-b4c2-812f5e36ba85" label="lyrics-like">lúmine tuo, et reges in splendóre</l><l xml:id="m-ce425083-9783-48e3-bb1e-aac4b782ae36" facs="#m-01ae20b4-f7dc-42e0-b991-393705542045" label="lyrics-like">Epha: omnes de Saba vénient, au¬</l><l xml:id="m-de9393ac-c3b9-4f37-8517-c6fbf1c7bd6e" facs="#m-03ec15a7-12d6-4e04-9b6c-3ff3129555f4" label="lyrics-like">rum et thus deferéntes, et laudem</l><l xml:id="m-25e3febd-182b-4358-a587-1b9d4123f354" facs="#m-8776ea4b-842b-4d80-b636-2382f192dedc" label="lyrics-like">ortus tui. Leva in circúitu óculos</l><l xml:id="m-57a27774-0e28-453b-a203-4be3bf83c69a" facs="#m-8566e820-d9c4-40ab-baad-ea240cf713cb" label="lyrics-like">Dómino annuntiántes.</l><l xml:id="m-850ede23-b925-46a9-ab5d-ac898b4cdb6d" facs="#m-795f019c-815d-4e06-a7b1-11b2a14d7713" label="lyrics-like">tuos, et vide: omnes isti congregáti</l><l xml:id="m-97194b85-95ec-4fbc-a4af-b839f766bcaa" facs="#m-e17692fc-3b4c-411f-a45a-6f52e20adb00" label="lyrics-like">sunt, venérunt tibi : filii tui de lon¬</l><l xml:id="m-1c13d0da-5781-4c9f-9464-f77702a50bec" facs="#m-6d2f039f-4aed-4fc8-8bb3-cd20c6599955" label="ambiguous">Grad.</l><l xml:id="m-910b52ed-0f2a-4139-b1ca-1bec4cb19e23" facs="#m-e27955ee-6c1a-4b43-95dc-43e9d1ba2e30" label="ambiguous">5.</l><l xml:id="m-e793701d-6068-4665-bf51-7da9b82035c8" facs="#m-52bc925b-98cd-45f9-bfd7-f43b06acfae0" label="ambiguous">0</l><l xml:id="m-48c92c03-86f9-45a4-b030-ac4f4e602000" facs="#m-d3096fca-590e-4e14-b33d-43a1938d6fd9" label="lyrics-like">mnes “ de Sá-ba</l><l xml:id="m-fc87f54a-f6cb-45db-9a0d-c3866b4e8767" facs="#m-1cb67e64-2f92-48e4-9f6d-dfb39931c066" label="lyrics-like">véni- ent,</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>